= Mieczysław Niedziałkowski

Mieczysław Niedziałkowski is the long-time editor-in-chief of Robotnik, our party newspaper. He is also a writer and advocate of socialism and stable polish politics.

- @media_
- @faction_support_
- @root: Return to main


@media_
title: Media
subtitle: Manage our party's newspapers and media.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 4; media_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: media


@faction_support_
