@support_international
on-arrival: internationalist_dissent -= 8; internationalist_strength += 8

Robotnik prints editorials in support of internationalist positions.

@support_center
on-arrival: center_dissent -= 8; center_strength += 8

Robotnik prints editorials in support of centrist positions.

@support_labor
